  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF emergency response to Vanuatu earthquake response &#xa3;400k</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring Education and WASH services for Children and Communities -The proposed programme, aligned with UNICEF&#x2019;s commitment to children&#x2019;s well-being, focuses on restoring education for children after the December 2024 earthquake in Vanuatu through ensuring safe learning spaces with appropriate WASH facilities, providing essential teaching and learning materials, launching relevant communication campaigns as well as restoring WASH services for affected communities surrounding schools.</narrative>
  </description>
